Variables : Definition

            A variable is a named memory location used to store data.
                                OR
            A variable is a named memory location used to store data temporarily during program execution.
                                OR
            A variable is a container that stores data which can change during program execution.

            SYNTAX :

                datatype variableName = value;

                   example :

                            int age = 20;

                            double salary = 45000;

                            char grade = 'A';

                            boolean passed = true;

                            String name = "Rahul";
                   Rules

                            Cannot start with number

                            Cannot contain spaces

                            Case Sensitive

                            Meaningful Names


                    int age = 20;

                    Memory

                    +---------+
                    |   20    |
                    +---------+
                         ↑
                        age


Why Do We Need Variables?

    System.out.println(20);
    System.out.println(20);

    Instead,
        int age = 20;

        System.out.println(age);
        System.out.println(age);

    Variables improve

        Readability
        Maintainability
        Reusability

    General Syntax
        datatype variableName = value;

        int age = 20;

        int      → datatype

        age      → variable name

        =        → assignment operator

        20       → value


    Variables are called variables because their values can change.


Declaration vs Initialization

    Declaration

        Creating the variable.

        int age;

        Memory is allocated.

        No value is assigned yet.

    Initialization

        Giving value.

        age = 20;

Variable Naming Rules

        Valid

            studentName

            age

            salary

            number1

            _marks

        Invalid

            1age

            student-name

            student name

            class

